       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. sum.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-INP1-VAL PIC 9 VALUE 0.
        01 WS-INP2-VAL PIC 9 VALUE 0.
        01 WS-SUM PIC 99 VALUE 0.
        
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
            DISPLAY "Hello World".
            ACCEPT WS-INP1-VAL.
            ACCEPT WS-INP2-VAL.
            COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-INP1-VAL + WS-INP2-VAL
            DISPLAY "SUM=" WS-SUM.
            STOP RUN.
